zlib-ng (2.3.3-1~osm1) UNRELEASED; urgency=medium

  * New upstream release.
  * Ship the zlib compatible library as libz-ng-compat, in the private
    directory /usr/lib/<triplet>/zlib-ng, so that it can be installed
    alongside zlib1g instead of replacing it. Drop libz1 and libz-dev.

